--[[
	Hack Others — Superpowers: ESP + Aimbot (single script)
	Place in: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts  (as a LocalScript)

	Controls
	  Q  (gamepad Y)        – ESP on / off
	  X  (gamepad X)        – Aimbot on / off
	  Hold right-click      – aim (gamepad: hold L2). Can be switched to
	                          "always aim" in the menu. On phones it always aims.
	  M  / eye button       – open / close the superpowers menu

	Both powers stay on until you turn them off. No timer, no cooldown.

	To lock a power for a player, set on the server:
	  player:SetAttribute("HasESP", false)       player:SetAttribute("HasAimbot", false)
	Set back to true to give it again.
]]

